#: ../../source/reference/cli/freeports-validate.md:1
msgid "`freeports-validate`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/reference/cli/freeports-validate.md:3
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Everything this command does revolves around one file: your **validation "
"document**, a YAML file at `<repo>/validation/<your_name>.yaml`, signed "
"by your GPG key. {doc}`../../guides/institutional/why-trust-a-grant` "
"explains why the mechanism is shaped this way; this section is how to "
"operate it."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/reference/cli/freeports-validate.md:7
