msgstr ""

#: ../../source/reference/cli/freeports-validate.md:8
msgid ""
"Unlike `freeports-dev`, this tool is a set of shell scripts, so it "
"depends on **programs**. Two of them are Python packages and are "
"installed with it; the rest must come from your system:"
